e": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "好的老师", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777183901, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1094332", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "好嘞好嘞", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777183909, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1099943", "content": {"messageType": 13, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "title": "04.20-04.26 自习报告", "linkUrl": "https://aries.yuanfudao.com/web/aries-web-pages/weekly.html?token=8L9_3fnjHIN14Qb5KG-G144lJRqCKS9e9OyfCx4VeOXER0y12y3qVA6KZWD9GIHz3ghD29kJY8LZrpzJLzTHUQ==", "imageUrl": "https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/1790568_9qe.png", "description": "从被动学到主动学：查收周周学习记录", "contentType": "LINK_CARD"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777274338, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1099945", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "梓萁妈妈，咱们宝贝报名后的第一次课程已经学完了，以上是孩子的学习报告~\n宝贝在课堂中的表现还是很出乎老师意料的，不仅在知识探究中展现出对知识点的渴求、也在小试牛刀中表现了对题目的严谨，老师非常开心能够看到宝贝有这么好的开始！☺", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777274341, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1099947", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "老师也想跟您说下咱们春季的学习规划，在后续的学习中海豚也希望宝贝们学的能够更加精准，做好下半学期的冲刺🏃，后面海豚会针对本学期的【重难点】【高频考题】【易错题型】去针对性的推送学习内容☺与校内同步，每周老师也会及时和您反馈孩子的学习情况，帮助孩子们能更牢固的掌握知识点，并搭配新课改的新题型帮助宝贝提前适应新知识点的吸收，稳稳领先其他同学！", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777274343, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1099949", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "另外也想问问咱们咱宝后面最迟周几前，能开始学习海豚课程，定好后我就能在规定的学习时间到点督促孩子了，您看咱们周几来学呢？", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777274346, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "receiverRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "messageRemoteId": "1100517", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "老师，孩子只能在周六晚上和周天上午学习", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777275295, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "receiverRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "messageRemoteId": "1100535", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "周一到周四晚上20.50放学，到家都九点半了，在吃饭洗漱没有时间\n\n周五要完成学校的作业\n\n周六班补，得补完才能写\n\n周日下午返校了\n\n能完成的时间只有周六晚或者周日上午", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777275407, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1102815", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "好嘞，也麻烦您多提醒孩子按时到点学习，保证有效学习时长，一定将【学-练-补】三个环节认真完成，我这边会继续全程跟进孩子的学习状态，咱们多多配合[嘿哈]后面老师也会同步给您最新的海豚后期学习安排，全面帮助宝贝备考[加油]有任何问题咱们随时沟通～", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777283822, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "receiverRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "messageRemoteId": "1102874", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "好的老师，我建立一个群他要是不认真或者您在后台看到他没有学习，也可以直接@他，然后他表现好，您也可以直接表扬他", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777283998, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "receiverRemoteId": "1