 "messageRemoteId": "1108001", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "老师我在群里回复了", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777361453, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1108265", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "梓萁妈妈，老师后台看到孩子来海豚学习啦，也简单跟您反馈一下~", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777362037, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1108270", "content": {"messageType": 16, "flag": 0, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "url": "https://dora-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/dora-encoder/audio/f9e858b7/f9e858b7-ec5e-4d1f-ae60-5bff2fe7ceb3.amr", "md5": "3db4fb000cd716c27eb6cb93412948b2", "size": 37304, "duration": 11, "mp3Url": "https://dora-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/dora-voice-mp3/f9e858b7-ec5e-4d1f-ae60-5bff2fe7ceb3.mp3", "decodeStatus": 2, "text": "因为开头宝贝就领先一步从为开成的非嘛，因为并且本周一按的要求人直些学的不以上了老师看到这个时堂都事你趟就后，这场因为我把海豚认真的利用起来了呢", "contentType": "VOICE"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777362041, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1108272", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "另外也跟咱们说一下，最近的知识点难度明显提高了很多，后续咱们订正完错题也别忘了完成错题本里的【举一反三】内容哦，这个功能不仅可以实时收录孩子在学习计划上做错的题目，还能给孩子练习同类型的题目，保证孩子真正学懂吃透薄弱点我截图发给您~", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777362045, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1108274", "content": {"messageType": 14, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "bigPicture": {"url": "https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/1550788_uqn_md5_15074046fcfbd091f43b7bf39c826124.jpg", "md5": "15074046fcfbd091f43b7bf39c826124", "size": 164640}, "smallPicture": null, "contentType": "PICTURE"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777362048, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1108276", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "前期学习习惯的养成是特别重要的，咱们梓萁做的非常好，所以也别忘了夸夸孩子哈，目前已经步入开学阶段，面对新的征程难免会有一些问题，但我可以说我对咱们宝贝有百分百的信心，这个关头千万不能退缩，咱们沉下心坚持前进，我也会陪着咱们一起，也请您多给孩子一些鼓励，我们一起努力！", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777362054, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "receiverRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "messageRemoteId": "1108496", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "好的老师，谢谢", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777362387, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "receiverRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "messageRemoteId": "1108505", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "1. 真实年级：初一下\n2. 海豚目前学习版本：\n 数学：初一、北师大版\n 英语：初一、上海教育出版社", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777362400, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1110194", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "咱们英语的通用版是涵盖了沪教版的，只是在顺序上略有差异。初中英语的核心就是词汇和语法，词汇咱们在海豚里也有7大词性和8大时态的知识点模块，咱们把这部分内容弄懂了，校内的知识点自然不在话下。", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777366658, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1114415", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "梓萁妈妈晚上好~因为七年级下学期本身学期短、进度紧，各科知识点难度大幅提升，文言文字词、英语复杂时态、理科逻辑题型都在加码，孩子适应起来有一定压力😔。这段时间我也一直关注梓萁的学习，所以我特意给孩子写了一封信，希望您抽空给孩子看看~[爱心]", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777389528, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1114417", "content": {"messageType": 14, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "bigPicture": {"url": "https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/6462781_i9o_md5_8a57b54312e18878420a2a766d8eecef.jpg", "md5": "8a57b54312e18878420a2a766d8eecef", "size": 1819645}, "smallPicture": null, "contentType": "PICTURE"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777389532, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1114419", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "另外马上到五一假期了，为了保证梓萁假期间有人跟踪学习，老师特意申请调休【4.29-5.2放假】。五一期间梓萁的学习任务已经全部规划好了，具体的学习时间安排表老师也发给您看看👇", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777389538, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1114421", "content": {"messageType": 14, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "bigPicture": {"url": "https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/6510228_2b6_md5_c3ee6bd2b53c584dc65f7dae52f59835.png", "md5": "c3ee6bd2b53c584dc65f7dae52f59835", "size": 1997851}, "smallPicture": null, "contentType": "PICTURE"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777389542, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "receiverRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "messageRemoteId": "1115520", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "老师收到了，谢谢真是费心了，传达给孩子看了，孩子也是信心满满，手写信真是用心了。感谢", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777430418, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1115946", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "好嘞，马上要迎来五一假期，咱们宝贝的学习也不能落下，希望咱们宝贝在五一期间既能玩得开心也能学的安心，所以我已经给咱们宝贝规划好了学习时间，按计划完成【学-练-补】三个环节，进行查漏补缺，咱们期中过后稳步推进，助力孩子更上一层楼[加油]", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777443144, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1123138", "content": {"messageType": 14, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "bigPicture": {"url": "https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/0197302_ben_md5_834b1ee7dcfed25d5d9db4f55a42c9d4.jpg", "md5": "834b1ee7dcfed25d5d9db4f55a42c9d4", "size": 676556}, "smallPicture": null, "contentType": "PICTURE"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777790269, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1123140", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "哇～看到孩子把一个学科完整学完了，真的特别棒！[庆祝]\n\n现在正是培养思维能力和学习习惯的关键时期，我们一定要鼓励宝贝继续保持这份自律，未来学习会越来越轻松[加油]～我也会持续关注孩子的成长，一起加油哦💪", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777790273, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "receiverRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "messageRemoteId": "1124917", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "好的收到老师", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777796144, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "receiverRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "messageRemoteId": "1124920", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "老师今明两天再给他释放点", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777796156, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1125656", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "好嘞", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777802829, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1131745", "content": {"messageType": 13, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "title": "4.6-5.3 阶段自习报告已生成", "linkUrl": "https://aries.yuanfudao.com/web/aries-web-pages/month-report.html?t=JTr8psexooqOT4PwVlsipw==", "imageUrl": "https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/1790568_9qe.png", "description": "孩子海豚AI学月底学习总结来啦，具体内容点击查看详细数据", "contentType": "LINK_CARD"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777884841, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1131747", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "梓萁妈妈，老师来和您同步一下宝贝近期的学习情况啦[爱心]！看到咱宝每周都在坚持打卡[强]，表现真的太棒啦~这段时间梓萁通过海豚定制答疑课和精细学情规划[哇]，对海豚的利用程度非常高[愉快]，已经养成了坚持打卡的好习惯[胜利]。为了更好帮助咱宝进步，我总结了后期学习的一些建议，您也点开好好听听~👇", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777884844, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1131749", "content": {"messageType": 16, "flag": 0, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "url": "https://dora-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/dora-encoder/audio/2d599794/2d599794-44bc-4142-9833-665cd75378f9.amr", "md5": "e3e370f4d2bfcf0cf4ca0bcd3eca4b34", "size": 117385, "duration": 35, "mp3Url": "https://dora-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/dora-voice-mp3/2d599794-44bc-4142-9833-665cd75378f9.mp3", "decodeStatus": 2, "text": "结合宝贝目前的学习情况来看现阶段起点难度加深，且五月份来连校内的进步。读都来到了本学期的重难点和关键节点一定下列是委生后期想要充费吧日常除了巩固学习计划里的课内知识点之外，还要充分利用海豚资料库的内容利用空闲时间进行。去搜索目前的薄洛卡点进行巩固学习，不仅可以夯实基础，还能避免前期知识点的忘同时校内新课开展前咱们也可以在资料库的视频资料里面进行前这一习了解新课课堂重点更快地跟上老师校应的节奏避免不对。", "contentType": "VOICE"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777884846, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1131751", "content": {"messageType": 14, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "bigPicture": {"url": "https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/1315138_ls5_md5_cc7cb16c7b269ee993de8e2370590510.png", "md5": "cc7cb16c7b269ee993de8e2370590510", "size": 503050}, "smallPicture": null, "contentType": "PICTURE"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777884852, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1131753", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "后续的海豚学习规划我先发给您👆\n海豚为了更好地帮助梓萁在不同学习阶段都能得到针对性的提升，也正在进行【服务+产品全面升级】。\n①延续小灶答疑课和1v1带学[让我看看]，稳步提升咱们综合解题思维🙋‍♀️\n②全面升级ai伴学功能，让小白精准匹配孩子学习节奏，实时跟进孩子的听课状态，帮助梓萁养成高效专注的学习，让宝贝提分更轻松。\n\n\n接下来2天，老师会着重针对【海豚的后期规划】给您详细介绍[笑脸]，您这几天一定要关注老师给您发的微信消息哦~", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777884857, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1135715", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "梓萁妈妈，本学期时间紧、任务重，学期过半后面的课程难度也会大幅提升！【相交线与平行线】是核心必考点，80%的孩子易丢步骤分!我开了 20 分钟小班带练，一场课仅8 个名额，点对点梳理解题思路，当堂过关✅，帮孩子稳稳提分💯！", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777950321, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1135717", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "今天我排了4节课，您快回我数字我直接在今晚带梓萁上课？👇\n\n\n①19:30-19:50\n② 20:00-20:20\n③ 20:30-20:50\n④ 21:00-21:20", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777950323, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "receiverRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "messageRemoteId": "1135892", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "1", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777951327, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1137183", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "好嘞", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777967091, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1139567", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "梓萁妈妈，最近的直播答疑也收到了很多好评，为了更好的帮助梓萁高效学习，老师昨晚加急整理好了海豚后期规划的~发您看看👇", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777971355, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1139569", "content": {"messageType": 14, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "bigPicture": {"url": "https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/7796053_c5j_md5_f9e7add718d3e399994420f6fa38acfa.png", "md5": "f9e7add718d3e399994420f6fa38acfa", "size": 531499}, "smallPicture": null, "contentType": "PICTURE"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777971359, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1139571", "content": {"messageType": 16, "flag": 0, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "url": "https://dora-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/dora-encoder/audio/6299531b/6299531b-dce7-41f0-af64-bba3a15cbd82.amr", "md5": "17544b9263395360d26273389138759d", "size": 130554, "duration": 39, "mp3Url": "https://dora-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/dora-voice-mp3/6299531b-dce7-41f0-af64-bba3a15cbd82.mp3", "decodeStatus": 2, "text": "自来是每个月都规划好了不同的学习重心里约开始我们会针对性的进行强化提升。我让孩子的薄弱点以及期中考后的情况进行定向突破全面是理知识体系六月，我们通过我期末每日一压题体。我有测验等形式，从此学期末帮助孩子考前打同知识忙区。吴是老师及时总结答技巧帮助孩子减少分数的流失，七月，我会当重心放在新学期知识点的提前分习上系统搭建初中知识框架同步巩固。就知识婆国内容其实渐近通基础，提前突破这难点帮助孩子提供衔接触东西。节奏挑战兴学期学习先机。", "contentType": "VOICE"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777971365, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1139573", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "对于 梓萁 来说，后期稳步跟上海豚的学习节奏，不仅能吃透本学期核心，针对薄弱点进行强化提升，期末在海豚的押题节奏下，还能提前预判考试风向，掌握高频考题。\n同时利用暑期时间，提前预习八年级上册，学习物理解题逻辑思维，平稳跨越衔接落差，打好基础，抢占学习优势", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777971370, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1139577", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "同时我也会全程实时关注梓萁的学习状态，跟进学习进度，及时发现问题、调整学习规划，您看咱们对这个规划还满意不？", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777971372, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1141374", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "这次课程为了能跟孩子更好的互动提问[转圈]，特地用的是咱们的腾讯会议上课哦[爱心]~老师把下载的图片发给您看看[玫瑰]~", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777975260, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1141378", "content": {"messageType": 14, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "bigPicture": {"url": "https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/5233870_kmj_md5_8bb86bf4100d6e4d413855401c4a4352.png", "md5": "8bb86bf4100d6e4d413855401c4a4352", "size": 606372}, "smallPicture": null, "contentType": "PICTURE"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1777975264, "msgSource"