senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1151054", "content": {"messageType": 16, "flag": 0, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "url": "https://dora-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/dora-encoder/audio/b774ef06/b774ef06-09da-46fd-a3a0-b27541220dbc.amr", "md5": "a40a07d2a3c033c0433a53ed0d577c1f", "size": 77664, "duration": 24, "mp3Url": "https://dora-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/dora-voice-mp3/b774ef06-09da-46fd-a3a0-b27541220dbc.mp3", "decodeStatus": 2, "text": "宝贝每上完在寒课程后呀。心都会实时同步装学紧。精确梳理，只是掌握情况点，您如鲁短班自在还能帮您分析清楚，还这个知识点会常出现。到时候们就好思维，我能上先发这个时能够清楚知道我还子思或者先发这。然后呢？寒等一下旁提上学科。", "contentType": "VOICE"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1778227520, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1151056", "content": {"messageType": 0, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "上面的语音您也点开好好听听👆\n咱海豚新AI上线后对咱们梓萁帮助还是非常大的[握手]能够全程互动，引导孩子思考。学习过程中，不仅有我和小白会实时关注孩子的学习状态，您也能随时看到孩子的课堂进度[呲牙]孩子在海豚学就再也不用您操心督促啦~\n\n您看新AI的功能我介绍的还清楚不？", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1778227526, "msgSource": 2}, {"senderRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "receiverRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "messageRemoteId": "1151214", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "清楚", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1778227832, "msgSource": 1}, {"senderRemoteId": "1688857665876682", "receiverRemoteId": "7881302649004601", "messageRemoteId": "1152162", "content": {"messageType": 2, "flag": 16777216, "senderName": null, "time": 0, "quoteMsgRemoteId": 0, "content": "好嘞，老师这边也会持续关注咱们宝贝的学习情况，后续AI的更新老师这边会及时跟您同步， 另外明天我们也有个专属预约活动，可以能帮孩子锁定学习优惠，咱们到时候可以先预约一下~", "ats": [], "contentType": "TEXT"}, "status": 1, "createdTime": 1778229139, "msgSource": 1}]